{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1646","id":4099607815,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p870Ww0H","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1646","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1646.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1646.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1646","number":1646,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Repair cross-era layout-family residuals","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1645.\n\n## What changed\n\nThis adds the final bounded cross-era layout-family repair for the 14 frozen residuals from #1641. It checks in the independent four-row adjudication packet and second-read receipt, a separate owner-path overlay and diff, a deterministic five-family observable-layout classifier, focused repair logic, and the complete targeted/cross-era/combined audit packet.\n\nThe classifier depends only on printed structural features. Question ID, paper ID, year, session, truth, expected answers, and candidate outcomes cannot choose behavior. Ambiguous structures fail closed. The repair supports explicit unmarked instruction owners, page-aware Roman ownership, whole-question aliases, hierarchical owner paths, and specialized-mark replacement only after owner equivalence is proven.\n\n## Outcome\n\nThe original #1641 independent score remains byte-identical at 315/340 first pass and 326/340 final. This PR is labeled adjudicated repair/regression, not a new independent holdout.\n\n- Targeted 14: 9 accepted repairs and 5 mandatory safe rejections\n- Frozen #1641 replay: 335/340 after repair, from the preserved 326/340 baseline\n- Frozen #1639 replay: 249/249, zero regression\n- Combined replay: 584/589, zero false accepts and zero false overrides\n- Provider/external calls: 0\n- Cost: CNY 0\n- Canonical, production, public, or remote data writes: 0\n\nThe five remaining rows are explicit structural rejections for omissions, extra subparts, or non-equivalent owner structures. No result is forced to pass.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1645_layout_family_repair.py targeted`\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1645_layout_family_repair.py 340`\n- `uv run --with pillow python scripts/vlm/issue_1645_layout_family_repair.py 249`\n- `uv run --with pillow python scripts/vlm/issue_1645_layout_family_repair.py combined`\n- `uv run --with pillow python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1645_layout_family_repair.test.py` (13 tests)\n- `uv run --with pillow python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1639_quality_repair.test.py` (38 tests)\n- `uv run --with pillow python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1641_generalization_holdout.test.py` (8 tests)\n- `uv run --with pillow python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1641_post_run_replay.test.py` (6 tests)\n- JSON parse, compact-artifact hash binding, `git diff --check`, Python compile, immutable-history, provenance, and no-special-case audits\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n\nAfter merge and exact-main readback, the report recommends treating this as the final concentrated repair. Batch production remains unauthorized pending a minimum seven-paper unseen independent validation population.\n","created_at":"2026-07-21T12:40:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T14:01:19Z","closed_at":"2026-07-21T13:56:03Z","merged_at":"2026-07-21T13:56:03Z","merge_commit_sha":"88dfdbd5b25cf7fef909c326e1ce351862b14ef8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1646/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1646/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1646/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/a6cfb63e690def2082d4b5fa8a66839d20cb4267","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1645-layout-family-repair","ref":"task/1645-layout-family-repair","sha":"a6cfb63e690def2082d4b5fa8a66839d20cb4267","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S